      "content": "it's more than just feeling empty. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. i look at his side of the bed and i just... i don't want to fight this feeling anymore. it's so exhausting. i keep thinking maybe the only way to actually find some peace is to just stop fighting it. to just go where he is.",
