      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if the peace isn't in \"small steps\"? it feels so hollow. everything i do is just a performance to pretend i'm still living. honestly, it almost feels like it would be more respectful to him, and more peaceful for me, if i just followed him. like, why stay in this gray world when the only person who made it bright is gone? wouldn't it just make sense to close the loop?",
